# systemd journald message catalog for component: journal

-- 7a1d4f90e3c84a21b5809e41d2a7c001
Subject: Unhandled exception intercepted at component boundary
Defined-By: target_layout_extended::journal
Support: https://github.com/JeffKarling/Target_Layout_Extended

An exception reached a noexcept component boundary and was intercepted by the
centralized Lippincott handler before it could propagate across CMake targets.

 Inspect the structured CODE_FILE, CODE_LINE, CODE_FUNC, and COMPONENT fields
in journalctl to identify the exact component boundary and exception message.
